To enhance the efficiency and performance of post-training stages, we propose a 5D parallel training paradigm. Within this framework, we optimize specific operators and implement targeted training acceleration for the RL stage. During inference, to improve user experience, we conduct optimizations in three key dimensions: model adaptation, streaming inference, and high concurrency scenarios. Details will be elaborated in the following sections.
